{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-chen-fortification","title":"綝惧亮亲政、称疾不朝、筑室朱雀桥南、诸弟分屯自固","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-efe4a500e6b93a9a82f8","label":"正文","text":"綝以亮始亲政多所难问甚惧，还建业称疾不朝；筑室朱雀桥南，使弟据入苍龙宿卫，弟恩、幹、闿分屯诸营，欲以专朝自固","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houzhu-p0013","role":"称疾不朝、筑室布防欲专朝自固","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0034","role":"入苍龙宿卫（威远将军）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0027","role":"分屯诸营（武卫将军）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0033","role":"分屯诸营（偏将军）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0166","role":"分屯诸营（长水校尉）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b","source_order":[64,455,0],"order":11021}],"persons":[{"id":"houzhu-p0013","name":"孙綝","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0027","name":"孙恩","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0033","name":"孙幹","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0034","name":"孙据","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0166","name":"闿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-75fa122396157be5217b","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-e9625f9b47fb4c167a95","layer":"original","quote":"綝以孙亮始亲政事，多所难问，甚惧。还建业，称疾不朝。筑室于朱雀桥南〖1〗，使弟威远将军据，入苍龙宿卫〖2〗；弟武卫将军恩、偏将军幹、长水校尉闿，分屯诸营：欲以专朝自固。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
